  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n\nA = {\n   {-u ux,      ux/z - u^2 m z,       ux^2},\n   { u/z,      -1/z^2,               -ux/z - u^2 m z},\n   {-u^2,       u/z,                  u ux}\n};\n\nv = {a Exp[x] + z^2 c Exp[-x],\n     2 b z,\n     a Exp[x] - z^2 c Exp[-x]};\n\nr = Simplify[A.v];\n\nAssuming[z != 0,\n  atExpr = Simplify[Exp[-x] (r[[1]] + r[[3]])/2];\n  btExpr = Simplify[r[[2]]/(2 z)];\n  ctExpr = Simplify[Exp[x] (r[[1]] - r[[3]])/(2 z^2)];\n\n  M = Normal @ CoefficientArrays[{atExpr, btExpr, ctExpr}, {a, b, c}][[2]];\n];\n\nJ = {{0, 0, 1}, {0, 1, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}; \nP = {{0, 0, -1/z^4}, {0, 1/z^2, 0}, {1, 0, 0}};\nP = {{0, -z^4/(2g), 0}, {-g z^2/4, 0, z^2 / (2g)}, {0, -g, 1}} /. {g -> Exp[-x]/(u-ux)};\nP = {{0, -z^4/(2g), 0}, {-g z^2/4, 0, z^2 / (2g)}, {0, -g, 1}} /. {g -> m};\nA = {\n    {0, 1/m, -(z^2)/(2m^2)},\n    {0, -1/z^2, 1/(2m)},\n    {0, 0, 0}\n};\n\nB = {\n    {0, 0, 0},\n    {m/(2z^2), -1/z^2, 0},\n    {m^2/(2z^2), -m/z^2, 0}\n};\n\nA=A/.{m->Exp[x]/(u+ux)};\nP=P/.{m->Exp[x]/(u+ux)};\n\nM//MatrixForm\nA//MatrixForm\nInverse[P].A.P//MatrixForm\n\nP // MatrixForm\nG = J.M.J /. {m -> 0};\nG // MatrixForm\nSimplify[Inverse[P].G.P] // MatrixForm\nM // MatrixForm",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
